---
import Layout from '../../../components/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Name Numerology Theory - Numero Girija">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href={`${base}learn/`}>Learning Portal</a> / <a href={`${base}learn/relationships/`}>Relationships</a> / Name Numbers
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h1 class="section-title">📝 Name Numerology Theory</h1>

        <div class="intro">
            <p>Your name is not just an identifier—it's a vibration that influences how others perceive you and what you attract in life. Name numerology reveals the hidden power of names and how to optimize them for success.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="systems">
            <h2>Two Main Systems</h2>
            
            <div class="system-card chaldean">
                <h3>🔮 Chaldean System (Recommended)</h3>
                <p><strong>Origin:</strong> Ancient Babylon, 4000+ years old</p>
                <p><strong>Method:</strong> Based on sound vibrations, doesn't use 9 (sacred number)</p>
                <p><strong>Accuracy:</strong> Considered more mystical and accurate</p>
                <div class="chart">
                    <p><strong>Letter Values:</strong></p>
                    <p>1: A, I, J, Q, Y | 2: B, K, R | 3: C, G, L, S | 4: D, M, T</p>
                    <p>5: E, H, N, X | 6: U, V, W | 7: O, Z | 8: F, P</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="system-card pythagorean">
                <h3>📐 Pythagorean System</h3>
                <p><strong>Origin:</strong> Ancient Greece, from Pythagoras</p>
                <p><strong>Method:</strong> Sequential 1-9, based on alphabetical order</p>
                <p><strong>Accuracy:</strong> More logical, widely used in the West</p>
                <div class="chart">
                    <p><strong>Letter Values:</strong></p>
                    <p>1: A, J, S | 2: B, K, T | 3: C, L, U | 4: D, M, V | 5: E, N, W</p>
                    <p>6: F, O, X | 7: G, P, Y | 8: H, Q, Z | 9: I, R</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="importance">
            <h2>Why Name Numbers Matter</h2>
            <div class="reason-grid">
                <div class="reason">
                    <h4>1. First Impression</h4>
                    <p>Your name is what people hear/see first—it creates immediate energetic impact before they know your DOB</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reason">
                    <h4>2. Professional Identity</h4>
                    <p>Business names, brand names, pen names all carry vibrations that attract or repel success</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reason">
                    <h4>3. Compatibility</h4>
                    <p>Name number should harmonize with your Driver and Conductor for maximum benefit</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reason">
                    <h4>4. Social Perception</h4>
                    <p>Others respond to your name's vibration subconsciously, affecting relationships</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="correction">
            <h2>Name Correction Guidelines</h2>
            <div class="guideline">
                <h4>✅ When to Correct Your Name</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Name number conflicts with Driver/Conductor (enemies)</li>
                    <li>Facing repeated obstacles in specific life areas</li>
                    <li>Want to enhance specific qualities (leadership, creativity, etc.)</li>
                    <li>Starting new business or career</li>
                    <li>After marriage (new surname consideration)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="guideline">
                <h4>🎯 Best Name Numbers by Driver</h4>
                <p><strong>Driver 1:</strong> Name numbers 1, 3, 9 (power, creativity, success)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 2:</strong> Name numbers 1, 2, 7 (balance, intuition)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 3:</strong> Name numbers 3, 6, 9 (abundance, harmony)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 4:</strong> Name numbers 1, 5, 6 (stability with dynamism)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 5:</strong> Name numbers 1, 3, 5 (freedom, communication)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 6:</strong> Name numbers 3, 6, 9 (beauty, love, service)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 7:</strong> Name numbers 2, 7 (spiritual, introspective)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 8:</strong> Name numbers 5, 6, 8 (material success)</p>
                <p><strong>Driver 9:</strong> Name numbers 1, 3, 9 (leadership, action)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="guideline">
                <h4>📝 How to Correct (Methods)</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li><strong>Add/Remove Letters:</strong> Add beneficial letters (A, E, I) or silent letters</li>
                    <li><strong>Change Spelling:</strong> Use Y for I, C for K, etc. (same pronunciation)</li>
                    <li><strong>Use Middle Name:</strong> Include/exclude middle name in signature</li>
                    <li><strong>Nickname:</strong> Adopt a nickname with favorable number</li>
                    <li><strong>Business Name:</strong> Choose favorable number for company/brand</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="guideline">
                <h4>⏰ Implementation Timeline</h4>
                <p>After name correction:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Start using new spelling immediately in all new documents</li>
                    <li>Update social media, email signatures, business cards</li>
                    <li>Legal change (optional but powerful) within 40 days</li>
                    <li>Allow 40-90 days for new vibration to manifest results</li>
                    <li>Old name vibration fades gradually over 6-12 months</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="examples">
            <h2>Real-World Examples</h2>
            <div class="example-card">
                <h4>Celebrity Name Changes</h4>
                <p><strong>Rajiv Hari Om Bhatia → Akshay Kumar:</strong> More powerful, action-oriented vibration</p>
                <p><strong>Farhan Abraham → A.R. Rahman:</strong> Spiritual, globally resonant</p>
                <p><strong>Inquiry Shadani → Katrina Kaif:</strong> Elegant, international appeal</p>
            </div>

            <div class="example-card">
                <h4>Adding Letters for Balance</h4>
                <p><strong>John (1+7+8+5=21=3) → Johnn (3+5=8):</strong> Changes energy to Saturn (discipline)</p>
                <p><strong>Sara (3+1+2+1=7) → Sarah (7+5=12=3):</strong> Shifts from introspection to creativity</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps">
            <h3>Continue Learning</h3>
            <div class="next-links">
                <a href={`${base}name-numerology/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>Calculate Your Name Number →</span>
                </a>
                <a href={`${base}learn/relationships/compatibility/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>Compatibility Theory →</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .breadcrumb { color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 500; }
        .breadcrumb a { color: #6b3fa0; text-decoration: none; }
        .intro p { color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        h2 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 30px 0 20px; }
        .system-card { border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .system-card.chaldean { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9f5ff, #f0ebff); border: 2px solid #6b3fa0; }
        .system-card.pythagorean { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe, #bae6fd); border: 2px solid #0284c7; }
        .system-card h3 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
        .system-card p { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .chart { background: white; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
        .chart p { font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .reason-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .reason-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
        .reason { background: white; border: 2px solid #e8e8e8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; }
        .reason h4 { color: #6b3fa0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
        .reason p { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .guideline { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9e7, #fef3c7); border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .guideline h4 { color: #d97706; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
        .guideline p, .guideline li { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .guideline ul, .guideline ol { margin-left: 20px; }
        .example-card { background: white; border: 2px solid #e8e8e8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .example-card h4 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
        .example-card p { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .next-steps { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9e5, #ffedd5); border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .next-steps h3 { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .next-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .next-link { background: white; border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.2s; text-align: center; }
        .next-link:hover { background: #f59e0b; color: white; transform: translateX(4px); }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .next-links { flex-direction: row; } }
    </style>
</Layout>
